    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "William",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Only the worthy ones deserve heaven”, hm? ",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "It feels different now when I hear it again when I read that letter.",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "William",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Come to think of it, I didn’t meet anyone here. ",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "thought",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "The sender told me in the letter that I’ll meet someone. ",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "thought",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "They even know those particular words… ",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "thought",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Hm, oh, well.",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "thought",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "UnloadSprite",
      "speaker": "William"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "William shakes his head from his own thoughts before he continues to look around the room. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Opening the drawers, looking under the bed, even wardrobes. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "He didn’t leave any nooks and cranny unchecked, yet made sure he didn’t change the position of the things present in the room just for the sake of it.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "William",
      "expression": "surprised",
      "position": "center"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "William",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "!!",
          "pacing": 0.14,
          "style": "emphasis",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "UnloadSprite",
      "speaker": "William"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "When he opened one of the drawers inside his mother’s side of the wardrobe, he found a medium locked jewelry box with his mother’s name carved on it. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "The box is light made of wood with a five digit combination padlock hanging on the edge. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Beside it, lies a poem on a piece of paper.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "William",
      "expression": "normal",
      "position": "center"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "William",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Oh… The box is locked. ",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Time to think of the password, then… ",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Does this poem have some connection with it?",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    }
